<!--
  The held mark.

  Filled, not outlined. An outline at this size — the mark is about eight device pixels
  across on the LP3 — is two hairlines with a gap between them, and a matte monochrome LCD
  turns that into a grey smudge. A solid shape stays a shape.

  Drawn inside 24x24 with a margin on every side, so it sits on the same optical line as
  the text beside it rather than crowding the row.
-->
